<view class="container reader-page">
  <view class="notice" wx:if="{{demo}}">以下为演示文字，并非真实播客转写。</view>
  <view class="status status-{{task.status}}" wx:if="{{task}}">{{statusLabel}}</view><view class="title page-title">{{task.title || '播客转文字'}}</view><view class="meta" wx:if="{{createdLabel}}">{{createdLabel}} 创建</view>
  <view class="loading-state" wx:if="{{loading && !task}}">正在打开文字…</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{task.status === 'completed'}}">
    <view class="filter-tabs"><button class="filter-tab {{aiView === 'original' ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAI" data-view="original">原文</button><button class="filter-tab {{aiView === 'condensed' ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAI" data-view="condensed">精简版</button><button class="filter-tab {{aiView === 'points' ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAI" data-view="points">核心观点</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{aiView !== 'original'}}">
      <view class="meta" wx:if="{{aiSettings}}">{{aiSettings.personal_configured ? '使用个人API' : '免费剩余 ' + aiSettings.trial_remaining + ' / 3 次'}} · <text bindtap="aiSettings">AI 设置</text></view>
      <view class="error" wx:if="{{aiError}}">{{aiError}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="loadAI">刷新状态</button></view>
      <view class="notice" wx:if="{{aiStatus === 'queued' || aiStatus === 'running'}}">正在后台提炼，可离开页面或关闭小程序，稍后回来查看。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{aiStatus === 'completed' && aiResult}}"><view class="caption">AI生成内容可能有遗漏或误解，请对照原文核验。重复查看不消耗次数。</view><view class="panel transcript" wx:if="{{aiView === 'condensed'}}" style="font-size:{{fontSize}}rpx"><text selectable>{{aiResult.condensed_text}}</text></view><view wx:else><view class="panel transcript"><text selectable>{{aiResult.summary}}</text></view><view class="dialogue-paragraph" wx:for="{{aiResult.key_points}}" wx:key="index"><text selectable>{{index + 1}}. {{item}}</text></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyAI">复制当前内容</button></view>
      <view class="panel" wx:if="{{aiStatus !== 'completed' && aiStatus !== 'queued' && aiStatus !== 'running'}}"><view class="name">保留重点，读得更快</view><view class="meta">一次生成精简正文、摘要和核心观点，共计1次。原文不受影响。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="generateAI" loading="{{aiSubmitting}}" disabled="{{aiSubmitting}}">{{aiSettings && !aiSettings.personal_configured && aiSettings.trial_remaining === 0 ? '配置个人API继续' : (aiStatus === 'failed' ? '重新生成' : '生成精简版与观点')}}</button></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{aiView === 'original'}}">
    <view class="reader-summary">全文 {{charCount}} 字 · {{expiresLabel}} 到期，请及时导出</view>
    <view class="reader-summary" wx:if="{{timingLabel}}">{{timingLabel}}</view>
    <view class="reader-actions reader-dock"><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制全文</button><button class="primary" bindtap="export" loading="{{exporting}}" disabled="{{exporting}}">导出 TXT</button></view>
    <view class="search-field reader-search"><input placeholder="输入关键词，筛选相关段落" value="{{query}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" /><button class="clear-button" wx:if="{{query}}" bindtap="clearFilter">清空</button></view>
    <view class="reader-toolbar"><view class="caption">{{query ? '匹配 ' + matchCount + ' 个文本段落' : '全文阅读'}}</view><view class="font-controls"><button class="font-button {{fontSize === 28 ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="setFont" data-size="28" aria-label="小字号">小</button><button class="font-button {{fontSize === 32 ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="setFont" data-size="32" aria-label="标准字号">中</button><button class="font-button {{fontSize === 36 ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="setFont" data-size="36" aria-label="大字号">大</button></view></view>
    <view class="caption" wx:if="{{query}}">筛选仅影响阅读，复制和导出仍为完整正文。</view>
    <view class="caption" wx:if="{{hasSegments}}">时间对应原音频；说话人编号由模型自动区分，可能有误。</view>
    <view class="dialogue-transcript" wx:if="{{hasSegments}}" style="font-size:{{fontSize}}rpx">
      <view class="dialogue-paragraph" wx:for="{{segments}}" wx:key="index">
        <view class="dialogue-meta"><text class="dialogue-time">{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.speaker || '未标注说话人'}}</text></view>
        <text selectable>{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="loading-state" wx:if="{{!segments.length}}">没有找到匹配的段落。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="panel transcript" style="font-size:{{fontSize}}rpx"><text selectable>{{text || '没有找到匹配的段落。'}}</text></view>
  </view>
    </view>
  <view class="panel" wx:if="{{task.status === 'failed'}}"><view class="error">{{task.error}}</view><button bindtap="search">重新搜索并提交</button></view>
  <view class="processing-state" wx:if="{{task && task.status !== 'failed' && task.status !== 'completed'}}"><view class="processing-track"><view class="processing-step current">{{statusLabel}}</view><view class="processing-step">文字就绪后即可阅读</view></view><view class="name">{{estimateLabel}}</view><view class="meta">{{statusHint}}</view><view class="meta">可切后台或关闭小程序，服务器会继续处理，无需保持亮屏。稍后打开“我的文字”查看结果，预计时间仅供参考。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="returnToTasks">返回我的文字</button></view>
  <button class="danger-button" wx:if="{{task.status === 'completed' || task.status === 'failed'}}" bindtap="remove" loading="{{removing}}" disabled="{{removing}}">删除这份记录</button>
</view>
